    "turn_text": "That I was very disappointed on Saturday when the president didn't address that part of it. And on Monday, I actually gave him credit for stepping up. to say I was shocked, I guess this guy can't continue to shock me, by the fact that on Tuesday he had switched back and suddenly is claiming in a sense he may be the only person who's trying to semi-defend or at least say moral equivalency of those groups. How hard is it as an American president or American leader to stand up and condemn Nazis?",
