    "turn_text": "I think it's to me it shouldn't be difficult at all. I think where maybe part of the issue lies though and I want to get your thoughts on this. is there was another group that was there, Antifa. Antifa's purpose is showing up. Granted, the rallies they're showing up are those kinds of rallies. It's not like they're showing up and causing chaos everywhere. But they are there for the specific purpose of storing things up, starting street bowls. That's what they do. That's what they want to do. Certainly, that kind of activity is abhorrent, is having races operating around Charlottesville is. When you have a group like that that is in there and mixing it up with them, that takes things up to a whole different level. But I don't hear a whole lot of people willing to mention them.",
